								<span class="trust-name">Identity</span>
							</div>
							<ul class="trust-list">
								<li><strong>Single sign-on</strong> over OpenID Connect, with an SSO-only mode when local passwords should stop being an option.</li>
								<li><strong>LDAP and Active Directory</strong> sign-in against the directory you already run.</li>
								<li><strong>SCIM 2.0 provisioning</strong>, so an account closed in the directory closes here too.</li>
